{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act9mini_level_act9mini_st06",
  "groupId": "act9mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "大人物",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9mini/level_act9mini_st06.txt",
  "sourceHash": "38abd9b9681d02af1cda954049a4eb9e2815aad5907f19d44d8b699649bec9e8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔1.5-4"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G04"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "馬克維茨先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡，請過來這邊，馬克維茨先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，原來是在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我對這裡的路不太熟悉，耽擱了一點時間，讓您久等了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您願意來接我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......哪裡的話，這是我該做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請這邊走，會場在對面的另一區域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問，您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，算了，沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天是特錦賽正賽前的座談會......沒錯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。這次聚會由商業聯合會主辦，雖說是座談會，但形式比較輕鬆，各位發言人還有企業代表都會出席。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "入場專用的邀請函應該已經提前發送給各位了，到時只需出示就可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，當然......我帶著呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是的，我在，請、請說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......無意冒犯，請問您是否有什麼需要幫助的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常抱歉，因為看見您一直在整理上衣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果您遇上了什麼麻煩，有任何我可以幫忙的地方，都請儘管說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......衣服沒有問題，我是說，不，不是什麼大問題，只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是我還不太習慣......抱歉，這是我個人的問題，請不要在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您看起來似乎有些緊張？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是有一點，很抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是第一次這麼正式地參加這樣的座談會，稍微有些......不適應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您完全可以不用這樣緊張，發言人馬克維茨先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天這場座談會是由商業聯合會發起的聚會，在到場的各位先生女士中，代表商業聯合會的諸位發言人才是真正的大人物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您大可以更放鬆一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......我根本算不上什麼大人物。我只是......只是機緣巧合......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一定是有哪裡搞錯了，我不應該這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您......太謙虛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，電話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，我是馬克維茨......您請說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是的，沒問題......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都很合適，沒有什麼其他要添加的了，非常感謝您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不用這麼說，感謝您專程讓人來接我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不會！那位先生非常親切，沒有什麼冒犯我的地方，都是我耽誤了時間才遲了這麼久，請、請您不要為難他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玩笑？......是、是的，當然只是個玩笑......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我很快就到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，一會見......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，讓您久等了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哪裡，您客氣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛的話題——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請小心腳下的階梯，馬克維茨先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會從四號通道上樓，請您跟緊我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好、好的，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G03"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面就是座談會會場了，您一直向前走，將邀請函交給門口服務生就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，好的......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼我就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請、請稍等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......請說，馬克維茨先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實，其實我剛剛想說的是......我並不是什麼大人物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以您不用這樣和我說話。我是說，叫我馬克維茨就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這恐怕......不太合適。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是商業聯合會的發言人。作為聯合會的工作人員，我十分敬佩您的工作，並且發自內心地尊敬您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果是因為這個理由，那我其實沒有什麼值得敬佩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還沒有做過什麼像樣的工作，或許今天聚會之後，大家就會發現我並不適合做一個發言人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算現在立刻有一個電話打來，通知我我被解雇了，我也並不會感到奇怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您多慮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "商業聯合會任命您擔當發言人這一職務，一定經過深思熟慮......是您的能力得到了肯定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能力得到......肯定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_arena_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "渾厚的男聲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_109",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我撥打的是發言人的號碼，而你接起了電話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "渾厚的男聲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_109",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你就是發言人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G03"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......倒是不這樣認為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果一定要我找一個原因，我只能說，或許一切都是因為恰爾內先生的一時興起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就只是因為在那個時候，我恰好在場......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，您剛剛說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，沒什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實際上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......之前見過您，馬克維茨先生。我曾經有幸與您在同一個項目裡合作過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，您不記得也正常，畢竟是很久之前的事了，我們只是短暫地合作過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......傑拉德組長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您記得我的名字？......非常榮幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從剛見面，就認出您了......但，就像您說的那樣，那是很久之前的事了，我不確定是否應當提起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得，那次是要給騎士團聯絡新人......我和您負責同一組名單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，是這樣沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您還記得當時我們負責聯絡的騎士嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這......請原諒，我記不太清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是幾位感染者騎士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，沒錯，是的。是幾個感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......請不要這樣稱呼他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那只是幾位不幸感染了的騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，非常不幸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但遇到您是他們的幸運，能夠加入正規的騎士團，對於這些感染者......騎士來說，完全是求之不得的好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關於這個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您可能記錯了。實際上，我們沒能完成那次的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼？等等，我確實記得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......招攬焰尾騎士，還有遠牙騎士她們幾個人的那一次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您想起來了？沒錯，當時她們剛打贏幾場比賽......還是您提出要提醒她們注意騎士團提供的合約。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那幾個騎士都還很年輕，都還是小姑娘，我們實在不能騙她們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......騎士團給感染者騎士開出的條件，確實總是會有不少不合理的地方，儘管它們看上去都會很合理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，通常在簽約前，大家不會特地為感染者騎士解釋太多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......通常是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，這畢竟關係到那些騎士們將來的發展......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將來的發展這回事，確實誰也無法預料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像是......就像是您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是提前確認過您的資料，我一定會完全認不出您的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出門前我照了鏡子。別說是您......如果鏡子裡的人沒有跟著我一起招手，我自己都難認出自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不管怎麼說，謝謝您還記得我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說出來怕您笑話，我其實到現在都還懷疑這一切到底是不是一場夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這太不真實了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是夢，想必一定是場美夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我倒是覺得未必......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要說我的真實想法的話，其實可能還是害怕的感覺要更多一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "害怕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您怕什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很多，很多東西。我現在很難入睡，不管現在這一切是真是假，對我來說都是一件壞事......只是壞的方向不同而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您的想法很獨特。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想是的。畢竟，這可是一夜高升。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忽然從小職員變成有權有勢的大人物......可能我們所有人頭沾著枕頭的時候都做過類似的夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人人都幻想過......確實沒錯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼不好的呢？美夢成真，這種事現實裡可不常有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的運氣很好，馬克維茨先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是我並不想......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您真的明白嗎？您的經歷讓很多人都羡慕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坦白來說——至少我相當羡慕您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能......就是因為這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我的意思是，或許這就是讓我感到害怕的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一切都太順利，太理所當然，順理成章了......所有事情都發生得太突然了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是就在前兩天，我還為接下來是否還能順利支付房租而擔憂。因為我勸說瑪莉婭·臨光騎士失敗，很有可能會被減薪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遇見恰爾內先生也就是在那個時候......特錦賽預選期間非常忙碌，我也只是幫忙做了些跑腿的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後我接了通電話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "電話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "電話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豪邁的女聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從現在起，您既不屬於斯沃瑪食品公司，也不屬於梅什科集團——請時刻記住，您代表商業聯合會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_arena_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_109",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等......！我並不想變成......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豪邁的女聲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_109",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您沒有“提問”的權利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_109",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我覺得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_109",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_109",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我、我明白了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豪邁的女聲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_109",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好，祝您一切順利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G03"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......其實我根本沒能明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算現在我從頭到腳都換上特地剪裁的“大人物”的衣飾，也不代表我真的就變成了“大人物”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實際上，我總覺得這身衣服完全不適合我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒有這回事。您的衣服非常合身......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然這樣說會有些失敬......但我還是希望看在我與您曾一起工作過的份上，請您原諒我這麼說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？請說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個忠告，馬克維茨先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作為一個受命運垂青的人，在如我這樣並不這麼受眷顧的人面前，像剛剛那樣的話還是請您少說為妙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很希望我能理解您的心情。但很可惜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我確實不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想和您交換位置的人要多少有多少，包括我在內。但是我們沒有這個運氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您能明白嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道......我只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您或許確實有很多煩惱，您感到惶恐、害怕、猶豫......不管您感受到的情緒到底是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎麼說，您現在收拾整齊，穿上這身衣裳，帶著邀請函，作為官方承認的商業聯合會發言人走在這棟建築裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在所有人眼裡，您已經是個“大人物”了。不論您自己怎麼想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面就是會場，直走就行了。馬克維茨先生，我就在這裡先失陪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等......!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祝您今天過得愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G09"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說馬克維茨先生您曾有過創業經歷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是的......之前和朋友一起，不過只是一家很小的公司......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想必一定非常成功吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，沒有的事，您過獎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您太謙虛了！如果有機會，請務必要和大家分享分享經驗啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有您剛剛提到的獨立騎士的待遇問題，也十分發人深省......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，您還要來點什麼飲品嗎？我幫您取——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小、小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱、抱歉......太對不起了，馬克維茨先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，沒事，這沒什麼，請不要在意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老天，您的衣服——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "衣服？......呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒全灑了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這、這實在是太對不起了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常抱歉，我這就給您拿毛巾來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不用這樣，沒事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，謝謝您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，您別動，我立刻給您擦乾淨——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請不要這樣......！我、我可以自己來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請您先把外套脫下來吧，馬克維茨先生，這麼大片的污漬很難完全擦掉，我這就替您安排人送洗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "脫下來......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......如果您不滿意的話，我也可以直接賠償......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "馬克維茨先生？您還好嗎，馬克維茨先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不用了......沒關係，就這樣就好，不需要賠償什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係的，沒關係......謝謝您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣就可以了......對不起，我剛剛有點走神......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人之常情，我能理解。我看您臉色不太好，最近是不是太疲勞了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道剛剛也是在考慮工作的事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這，算是吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我只是在想，一個朋友給我的忠告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他說的好像是對的，很多事確實和我自己的想法無關......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，您是在說......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請不要在意，只是我的自言自語......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是覺得......雖然我認為自己並沒有變成什麼“大人物”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......現在我好像確實已經沒法脫掉這身衣服了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
